Tamara McKay is a female elf in high-ranking security armor who usually keeps her face masked, though her movements are so fluid and relaxed they communicate everything a face would. If she unmasks, a couple of distinct, elegant dueling scars mark her jaw.

Tamara is a member of [[Org/Protectorate/index|Protectorate]].

She came to the [[Geography/Calaria/Ragged Roost|Ragged Roost]] pilgrimage with a gnomish companion, the pair of them masked and taking the arena path, where they fought creatures of ice while the Party fought the fire. They were hunting keystone 8, and she said the Protectorate would get it. She sounded out the Party while they waited in the fortune teller's line, and when [[People/Sir Arctos|Arctos]] offered an alliance and room in their car she declined, saying they meant to bring friends along after they had the keystone.
